    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/4f52e8181229d31d85760cda5493f385.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div><br><br><strong>Out of Three</strong> is a 3-player Local Multiplayer Boss Rush game. Lost in a dungeon, you and your two comrades must survive a terrible monster: Gorgon. Beware! 3 inexperienced villagers like yourselves are obviously no match. Fortunately, the gods are merciful and decide to lend you the 3 weapons of the trinity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/f20e8b117600c54aa872f8f76bbb5a2a.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div></h2></h2><br><strong>The Bloody Fists: </strong>These boxing gloves belonged to the infamous Tiger-eyed Boxer. Wearing them allows you to drain your enemy's life points when hitting them, restoring your own.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/786162aef8316c10bcf0212f6e03a35d.poster.avif?t=1700733972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/786162aef8316c10bcf0212f6e03a35d.webm?t=1700733972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>The Spield:</strong> Can't make up your mind between a spear or a shield? The Spield is the perfect choice. Attack your ennemy while reflecting some damage when shielding at the right time!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/493a819d8cda2c0381488de62fa28b85.poster.avif?t=1700733972\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/493a819d8cda2c0381488de62fa28b85.webp?t=1700733972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><strong>The Lyre: </strong>If music is your thing, you should use the Lyre to harm Gorgon from afar with your false notes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/e6e027d2436bfa411475b58d249adf2a.poster.avif?t=1700733972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/e6e027d2436bfa411475b58d249adf2a.webm?t=1700733972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/ce9365b7ef1ae08af40c6737d3429f8c.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div></h2></h2>Amidst chaos and disarray, you must find a way to cooperate with your friends to beat the boss. Swap weapons with your teammates and come up with the best strategy. Start from scratch, become true heroes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/3569eb94ec2eaff8e239ef80547f1b20.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div></h2></h2>You'll have to swap weapons during battle if you want your party to be the most efficient. Studying each weapon will come in handy to become a real asset for your team.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/3d4cfa0fd67606d6b77e750abfe90d44.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div></h2></h2>thank you Pernambuco for these amazing musics!<br><br>You can go on his spotify or Youtube channel to see his work !",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/4f52e8181229d31d85760cda5493f385.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div><br><br><strong>Out of Three</strong> is a 3-player Local Multiplayer Boss Rush game. Lost in a dungeon, you and your two comrades must survive a terrible monster: Gorgon. Beware! 3 inexperienced villagers like yourselves are obviously no match. Fortunately, the gods are merciful and decide to lend you the 3 weapons of the trinity.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/f20e8b117600c54aa872f8f76bbb5a2a.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div></h2></h2><br><strong>The Bloody Fists: </strong>These boxing gloves belonged to the infamous Tiger-eyed Boxer. Wearing them allows you to drain your enemy's life points when hitting them, restoring your own.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/786162aef8316c10bcf0212f6e03a35d.poster.avif?t=1700733972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/786162aef8316c10bcf0212f6e03a35d.webm?t=1700733972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>The Spield:</strong> Can't make up your mind between a spear or a shield? The Spield is the perfect choice. Attack your ennemy while reflecting some damage when shielding at the right time!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/493a819d8cda2c0381488de62fa28b85.poster.avif?t=1700733972\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/493a819d8cda2c0381488de62fa28b85.webp?t=1700733972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><strong>The Lyre: </strong>If music is your thing, you should use the Lyre to harm Gorgon from afar with your false notes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/e6e027d2436bfa411475b58d249adf2a.poster.avif?t=1700733972\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/e6e027d2436bfa411475b58d249adf2a.webm?t=1700733972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/ce9365b7ef1ae08af40c6737d3429f8c.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div></h2></h2>Amidst chaos and disarray, you must find a way to cooperate with your friends to beat the boss. Swap weapons with your teammates and come up with the best strategy. Start from scratch, become true heroes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/3569eb94ec2eaff8e239ef80547f1b20.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div></h2></h2>You'll have to swap weapons during battle if you want your party to be the most efficient. Studying each weapon will come in handy to become a real asset for your team.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226030/extras/3d4cfa0fd67606d6b77e750abfe90d44.avif?t=1700733972\" /></div></h2></h2>thank you Pernambuco for these amazing musics!<br><br>You can go on his spotify or Youtube channel to see his work !",
    "short_description": "Out of Three is a local multiplayer Boss Rush game that can be played with 3 players. The goal: defeat the Boss Gorgone by cooperating with your team members. You and your 2 faithful comrades find yourselves in an unknown dungeon, face to face with a giant medusa. Your fate seems inevitable!",
